Package: fap
Type: Package
Title: Fast AlphaPulldown: AlphaFold Complex Predictions of GPCRs with Ligands
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kevin Brulois
Maintainer: Kevin Brulois <kevin.brulois@gmail.com>
Description: Builds, submits and post-processes AlphaPulldown and AlphaFold 3
    jobs that pair GPCRs with candidate ligands on the Sherlock cluster: job
    tables, features and initial-guess poses, metric and contact extraction,
    AlphaFold 3 runs, coevolution, and models of the extracted contacts.
    Split from ligandFinder, whose residue database and helpers it uses.
License: What license is it under?
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
